  "content": "<p>Bake detail from a high-poly sculpt onto a low-poly, game-ready mesh using normal and ambient occlusion maps.</p>\n<h2>Learning Objectives</h2>\n<ol>\n<li>Prepare high- and low-poly meshes for baking</li>\n<li>Set up a cage and bake normal and ambient occlusion maps</li>\n<li>Diagnose and fix common baking artifacts</li>\n</ol>\n"
